WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.460
I'm sorry about
what happened with Nora.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.800
That was likely the extent of her level.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:15.300
However, there is no worth
in investigating Reina's child.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:17.470
But she may possess superior

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.930
There is no such possibility.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:26.900
After all, no one can
possibly surpass the Neo-Genes...

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.950
"Family"

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:08.120
Um.. What kind of place is it? The place we'll be staying at

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:10.290
It's the top floor of a condominium.

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:15.710
It may be a bit different from
the places you've lived in before.

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:19.590
O-Okay...

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:22.890
It's all right. There's no need to worry.

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:26.310
You're my daughter now.

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:29.180
Okay...

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:35.770
Have relocated Rihoko to my home.

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:39.700
Commencing record of our
parent-daughter relations as of today.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:45.490
Wow! It's so big!

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.870
There is a room for you, too.

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.040
Here it is.

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:54.290
Wow!

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:56.750
It's almost like a toy store!

00:02:56.840 --> 00:03:00.050
I didn't know your preferences,
so I gathered a variety of items.

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:02.970
If there's anything lacking, just let me know.

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:05.720
Eh? This is more than enough...

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:07.010
Play until dinnertime.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:09.640
Oh, I can make dinner!

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:11.940
I'm actually pretty good at cooking!

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:13.190
No, thank you.

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:16.150
It's a mother's job to prepare dinner.

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:18.320
Children are supposed to play.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.030
Okay...

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:24.410
Umm, but please come get me
if there's anything I can help with!

00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:26.280
Thanks.

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:36.960
There are no particular issues
with Rihoko's actions at present time.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:41.720
Some agitation is apparent,
but is no cause for concern.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:45.180
I, myself, have not experienced
any noteworthy changes.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:48.510
Things are proceeding extraordinarily well.

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:54.020
This is so screwed up!

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:57.060
Real mother, my ass!
I don't care what anyone says;

00:03:57.150 --> 00:04:00.440
Masamune-Chan is Rihoko-Chan's mother!

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:05.950
"A child is what his parents make!"
People long ago were smart!

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:10.700
Ever hear of Judge Ooka?
I'm pretty sure foster parents raised

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:15.540
It's not our place to butt in.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.460
I just can't accept it...

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:20.300
They were the ones who decided.

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:27.720
But I just can't stand to see
Masamune-Chan like that...

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:02.880
There's gotta be another side to all this...

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.720
Dammit!

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:20.690
The Cloneblade is in its final stage.

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:25.780
It could well produce results beyond
our hopes when Maria puts it on!

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:30.660
Maria herself has begun to
demonstrate great motivation for training.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:34.750
It seems the promise was indeed effective.

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:36.660
Thank you, Maria!

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:39.080
You seem in rather high spirits today!

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:43.170
Yeah! Once this is over,
I get to find out about my mom!

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:45.960
Hurry and put the Cloneblade on me!

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:49.590
I'm sorry, but it's still
in the fine-tuning stage.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:52.720
Anyway, Maria, we need to record
your physical data, so come over

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:53.760
Why?

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.180
Eh?

00:05:55.270 --> 00:06:01.480
Why can't you do it yet?!
I've been working so hard!

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:02.360
Hmph!

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:08.070
I hate them all! I hope they all die!

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:15.450
Hey, did you know?

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:21.500
Mom can do anything. She'll do whatever I ask.

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:28.670
She would never do anything bad.
She'll always, always be with me...

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:33.100
I wonder what she's like, my mom?

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:39.140
I guess her mental age just
hasn't caught up with her body...

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:42.270
It varies for each individual...

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:46.610
Wow! It's like a restaurant meal!

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:47.820
Let us eat.

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:50.490
Right! I humbly accept this!

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:55.780
It's delicious!

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.500
Is it? That's good.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:15.680
This soup is seasoned with milk
and butter, but no consommé, right?

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:18.850
I simply made everything as per their recipes.

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:21.310
So you don't normally cook?

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:22.640
No.

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:30.530
It's amazing you can make
something so delicious,

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.490
even though you don't normally cook...

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:37.080
Isn't that a mother's job?

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:47.670
Yum! Your cooking's totally the best, Riko!

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:50.590
Something wrong?

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:53.050
This is delicious!

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.310
Your bedroom is that way.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:09.480
Oh, we hadn't said good night yet, so...

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:12.070
Oh. Good night.

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:19.080
Oh, I'll do it for you!

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.700
I'll brush from behind!

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:25.670
That's all right. I can do it myself.

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:36.720
What's wrong?

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:40.310
Nothing. Good night.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:52.280
Mom! Quit moving!
Riko! You're tickling me!

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:57.360
No...

00:08:57.450 --> 00:09:03.660
My mom is Reina-san. She's my mom...

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:08.120
"Amaha - Jack of All Trades"

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:24.520
Day 1 of cohabitation has ended.
No incidents worthy of report.

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:27.690
No internal changes within
myself have manifested

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:44.620
Partial revision.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:49.670
My own Blade-induced breakdown
appears to have begun. End report.

00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:59.760
You don't seem to be eating much, either...

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:02.510
Why do you ignore my calls?

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:07.480
What if an emergency assignment comes up?

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:09.190
Have you forgotten our contract?

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:10.770
It's canceled.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:12.060
What?

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:19.280
I have no reason to fight
anymore, or to earn money...

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.860
Don't be stupid!

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:23.530
You're wearing the Witchblade!

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:26.330
You can't just up and quit whenever you want!

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:28.080
Then you can have it.

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:34.500
Go ahead, just lop it off,
or do whatever you want.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:38.090
Come on!

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:41.550
What's the big idea, Takayama?!

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:44.180
No! Let go of me!

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:45.510
Let go!

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.100
Woo-woo!

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:53.770
What's this about?

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:59.280
We can't let our prized Witchblade
wearer be sabotaged any further.

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:05.490
Fine. I did tell you to
do whatever you want...

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:15.130
Say, you used to go out
with Sohou Reina, right?

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:19.170
Don't tell me Riko's father is...

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:23.680
It's not an impossibility...

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:26.680
Wait... That's all?!

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:34.690
Yeah... I guess it's not
my business either way.

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:40.490
After all, I'm not her mother anymore...

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:53.120
Umm, why don't we go outside?

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:54.080
What for?

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:57.500
Well... The weather is really nice.

00:11:57.590 --> 00:12:00.380
We could take a walk, or go shopping...

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:03.470
I can go shopping for you later.

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:06.510
You can play all you like.

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:10.310
Okay...

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:14.890
What's wrong?

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:17.650
Umm, well...

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:24.610
Umm... What's wrong?!

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:25.660
Stay away!

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:31.290
I'm fine! Go somewhere else!

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:35.500
Okay...

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:48.010
Now then, ladies and gentlemen
of the Witchblade Project.

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:51.310
You are the ones who will
carry Douji into the future.

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:56.690
I have faith you'll make mass
production of the Witchblade a reality.

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:03.570
My respect goes to the Special
Section for all its efforts so far,

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:07.820
but it's a fact that they've wasted
a bit too much time and work.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:11.700
The Bio Section will not repeat their failures!

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:15.660
We will achieve swift success!

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:21.750
He's serious about crushing us now.

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:28.760
I see. So now the Bio Section has
its own Witchblade research team...

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:31.180
There's turmoil within our own section.

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:35.730
Shouldn't you leave Masane-san
with someone so you can return?

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:38.600
No. Let him do what he wants for now.

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:43.980
But his confident attitude makes me
think there's another side to this...

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:48.740
He's failed once before.
He'll do no better this time.

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:50.070
Sir!

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:55.870
Don't blame me if something happens...

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:59.750
You don't need to go back? Aren't you busy?

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:01.670
This is work, too.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:06.420
We really need you back on your feet ASAP.

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:11.930
So where are you taking me?

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:15.270
Your real hometown.
Eh?!

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:22.940
"Children's House"

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:27.650
We dug into your past,
from before the Great Quake.

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:30.610
And that led to here.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:32.490
Here?

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:42.420
You grew up here, until you were 1 7.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.960
What about my parents or siblings?

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:49.800
We tried our best, but we found nothing...

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:54.640
What we do know is that
the people here were caught...

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:58.060
...in the earthquake six
years ago, while on a trip.

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:00.940
All of the staff and children died.

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:05.860
Having lost its residents,
this place was shut down.

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:10.820
I don't know this place.

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:14.370
But you did live here for 1 7 years.

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:19.700
For the next six years,
you've lived as Amaha Masane.

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:23.540
Does the name Ohara Yasuka ring any bells?

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:26.130
Ohara... Yasuka?

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:29.420
It's your real name.

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:33.340
I don't know. I don't remember.

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:36.050
You really can't remember anything?

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:37.510
Look around more!

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:41.100
I told you, I don't remember.

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:42.640
What is it?!

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:45.230
There's one missing...

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:49.480
It's gotta be somewhere. I'll go look for it.

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:06.790
"Ohara Yasuka"

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:11.670
The one here... was the real me...

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:22.520
I don't know her... I don't
know that version of me...

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:26.650
It's no use. I can't remember anything.

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:29.480
I was naive.
How so?

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:33.610
You're simple-minded, so I thought
you'd remember if you came here.

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:35.410
Oh, geez.

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:37.530
Find what you were looking for?

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:42.080
No, so I got this instead...

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:49.340
It's just like me...

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:55.630
It's lacking. It's out of place. This is me.

00:16:55.720 --> 00:17:01.680
The family I never had, my old self
that vanished in the earthquake...

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:08.350
It's no use. They'll never come back.

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:13.190
There's nothing that
can ever make up for it...

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:17.490
I shouldn't have done this...

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:25.910
I knew it wouldn't be easy. But...

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:29.790
Say, what about your family?

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:32.670
I just realized you've
never mentioned them...

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:36.630
You look like you were
a spoiled rich kid, though...

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:40.260
Good question. I'm not really sure.

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:41.970
You're not sure?

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:45.680
About what a family is.

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:48.100
My mother died early on.

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:52.650
My father was hardly ever
home because of work.

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:57.610
We're definitely connected
by blood, but that's it.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:59.280
Oh...

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:03.080
After seeing you two,
I finally felt I understood

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:08.080
what a true family is like...

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:11.960
Say...

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:16.590
Did we really seem like a family?

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:22.050
Yeah. You were bonafide
mother and daughter.

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:28.600
Yeah... After all, I have nothing else...

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:35.650
Riko is my one and only

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:45.790
Riko... Rihoko...

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:59.720
Splendid!

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:08.140
You've done well to come this far,
my adorable daughter.

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:09.930
Grandfather!

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:12.730
You promised! Tell me about my mom!

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:15.520
That, right off the bat?

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:19.190
Knowing about her won't
change anything, you know...

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:21.240
That's not true!

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:24.160
I really wanna know about my mom!

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.080
C'mon! Hurry!

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:32.580
This is my mom!

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:35.670
Here it is again.
The same genetic code as before...

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:39.920
Yeah, so the father's
genes are the same?

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:46.550
It seems all the Neo-Genes here
share the genes of a single father.

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:51.680
So they're half-sisters, huh?
So that's why they're called "sisters"...

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:57.190
Still, is this father that
extraordinary of a person?

00:19:57.270 --> 00:20:00.650
Where's his file?
It's not here.

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:07.240
It either just happens to be missing,
or it's being kept pretty top-secret.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:09.080
You can't be serious...

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:13.250
They all have the genes of real beauties,

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:16.880
so they're all in the very
center of my strike zone!

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:19.050
Hold it!
Eh?

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:21.420
Who's this?!
Huh?

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:24.840
These are the mother data files...

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:26.140
Mother?

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:32.100
They provide the mother genes to
the newest generation Neo-Genes.

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:40.480
Mom... I'll see you soon!

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:48.620
I didn't ask for any.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:51.490
I know. But please have some!

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:56.750
Umm... Can I help you prepare dinner?

00:20:56.830 --> 00:21:02.840
I want to get better at cooking,
plus I want to be with you more...

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:07.680
I want to talk with you lots more...

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:12.810
What's wrong?!

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:16.810
It appears to be a hypersecretion
of tear fluid. I'm fine.

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:22.480
Changes in my endocrine system
are likely affecting bodily functions

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.650
Are you all right?

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:33.080
What is this?

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:40.080
What is this sensation?

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:54.740
I turn around half-asleep as my hits the right side of my cheek

00:21:54.740 --> 00:22:02.990
Your voice was there, and the air was warm

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:11.260
Your right hand grazes my left shoulder

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.730
But why don't you hold on tight?

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:28.500
In order to change yesterday's wish tomorrow,

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:35.690
I need to grow stronger myself

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:44.840
Even now, I am breathing in your scent, ...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:53.510
and jumping over to your side. Give me your love.

00:22:55.180 --> 00:23:02.990
Extend your hands. Reach them out to me.

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:09.540
I'm so happy

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:14.100
Are you doing well?

00:23:14.180 --> 00:23:18.520
I didn't get to tell you about the house,
so I'll write it down here.

00:23:18.600 --> 00:23:23.520
The hangover medicine is in
the second drawer in the kitchen.

00:23:23.610 --> 00:23:26.320
There's Salisbury steak in the refrigerator.

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:31.780
When you buy onions, choose ones
that are green up to the leaves.

00:23:31.860 --> 00:23:36.780
Try not to drink too much, and please
make sure to eat your meals.

00:23:36.870 --> 00:23:40.120
I'm doing fine.
